{"id":151,"flavor":[{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!","Yellow"],"text":"When viewed through a microscope, this Pokémon’s short, fine, delicate hair can be seen."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Mew is said to possess the genetic composition of all Pokémon. It is capable of making itself invisible at will, so it entirely avoids notice even if it approaches people."},{"games":["Y","SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"Its DNA is said to contain the genetic codes of all Pokémon, so it can use all kinds of techniques."},{"games":["X","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"Because it can use all kinds of moves, many scientists believe Mew to be the ancestor of Pokémon."},{"games":["HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"Apparently, it appears only to those people who are pure of heart and have a strong desire to see it."},{"games":["LeafGreen","Blue","Red"],"text":"So rare that it is still said to be a mirage by many experts. Only a few people have seen it worldwide."},{"games":["FireRed"],"text":"A POKéMON of South America that was thought to have been extinct. It is very intelligent and learns any move."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"A MEW is said to possess the genes of all POKéMON. It is capable of making itself invisible at will, so it entirely avoids notice even if it approaches people."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"Because it can learn any move, some people began research to see if it is the ancestor of all POKéMON."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Synchronize","hidden":false,"description":"If the Pokémon is burned, paralyzed, or poisoned by another Pokémon, that Pokémon will be inflicted with the same status condition."}],"eggGroups":["Undiscovered"],"genderRate":-1,"hatchCounter":120,"baseHappiness":100,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":"rare","color":"Pink","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":151,"name":"Mew","condition":null,"children":[]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,1],[1,513],